  diagnosisChoices:
  - diseaseId: PHARYNGITIS
    diagnosisName: Farenjit
    resultText: "Bulgular farenjit ile uyumlu. Bo\u011Faz a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n
      bask\u0131n olmas\u0131, yutkunma ile artan a\u011Fr\u0131, farengeal hiperemi
      ve servikal lenf nodu hassasiyeti tan\u0131y\u0131 destekliyor."
    isCorrectDiagnosis: 1
    recommendedTags:
    - throat_pain_yes
    - odynophagia_yes
    - pharyngeal_hyperemia
    - cervical_lymph_tenderness
    - fever_mild
    - runny_nose_mild
  - diseaseId: COLD
    diagnosisName: "So\u011Fuk Alg\u0131nl\u0131\u011F\u0131"
    resultText: "Hafif ate\u015F, \xF6ks\xFCr\xFCk ve burun ak\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131
      so\u011Fuk alg\u0131nl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFCrebilir;
      ancak bu vakada bo\u011Faz bulgular\u0131 daha bask\u0131n ve muayene farenjiti
      destekliyor."
    isCorrectDiagnosis: 0
    recommendedTags:
    - runny_nose_yes
    - sneezing_yes
    - nasal_congestion_yes
    - gradual_onset
    - low_grade_fever
  - diseaseId: GRIP
    diagnosisName: Grip
    resultText: "Gripte genellikle ani ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7, y\xFCksek ate\u015F,
      belirgin kas a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131 ve a\u011F\u0131r halsizlik beklenir. Bu
      hastada tablo daha \xE7ok lokal bo\u011Faz bulgular\u0131 \xFCzerinden ilerliyor."
    isCorrectDiagnosis: 0
    recommendedTags:
    - high_fever
    - acute_onset
    - muscle_pain_yes
    - fatigue_severe
    - cough_yes
